{"script":"yd_005_06","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara005_1_face_chara005_1g","layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"x":280,"scaleY":1,"trans":false,"bright":1,"y":-297,"img":"chara005_1"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara005_1_face_chara005_1g","timeBak":300,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"nonStandBright":false,"x":280,"transTime":0,"scaleY":1,"trans":false,"bright":1,"y":-297,"img":"chara005_1"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"茜塔","text":"[show]感觉自己在旅店工作中学到的东西，也能活用到营地里来呢。[r]打扫卫生、烹饪、帮忙接待来客……只要你开口，我都可以帮忙。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara005_1_face_chara005_1c","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"茜塔","text":"[show]不需要？因为我是你的房客，姑且也付了房租，所以不想麻烦我？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara005_1_face_chara005_1a","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"茜塔","text":"[show]哼……这又不是加班。我们都相处这么久了，怎么还这么见外。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"茜塔","text":"[show]就算是房客，是契约者同事，我们之间更是朋友吧？[r]朋友之间互相帮助，怎么也不至于“麻烦”。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara005_1_face_chara005_1g","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"茜塔","text":"[show]或者说……你期待着驿站旅店的侍者，能提供什么更特殊的服务？[r]放心吧，想也不可能有啦。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"des":"茜塔-熟识3"}